// expect: 66
// String-literal patterns HIT: the pattern-position literal is the same
// interned constant the expression position emits, compared str_eq. The
// wheel's emit floored pattern strings to address 0 (walk_lemit_arms never
// interned them), so every arm missed and wildcards swallowed the dispatch —
// infer_seq_op typed every len/slice/... call TList, the 284-fn eq-dispatch
// flip census between m3 and m4 (2026-07-10). 22+11+33 = 66.
fn pick(s: String) = match s {
  "alpha" => 11,
  "beta"  => 22,
  _       => 33
}

fn main() = pick("beta") + pick("alpha") + pick("gamma")
